[statement]
A package whose condition the preliminary choices complete is chosen too,
and steers the earlier choices it contradicts. `F` is decided before `B`,
yet `f1`, its best candidate, is passed over: `base`, the best candidate
for `B`, completes the condition of `e`, whose dependency `S` has `s1`
alone, which holds `K`, as `f1` would. Contrast
`a-condition-that-will-hold-steers-an-earlier-choice-not-when-another-is-chosen`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:z B

P:base
V:1
k:9
p:B

P:base2
V:1
k:5
p:B

P:z
V:1
D:F

P:e
V:1
i:base
D:S

P:f1
V:1
k:100
p:F K=1

P:f2
V:1
k:10
p:F

P:s1
V:1
p:S=1 K=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install f2 1
install z 1
install base 1
install s1 1
install e 1
install top 1
